		<label>Anneli Faction Tokiwano Gakuen</label>
		<description>Annelitrice Tokiwano Gakuen is founded on a simple belief: nothing in life is better than being a high school student. Friendship, club activities, sports competitions, tea parties, awkward confessions, and complicated love triangles are treated as the ideal form of existence.\n\nTheir entire society is organized like a school. Every citizen is a Student and belongs to one or more clubs, which handle everything from farming and manufacturing to medicine and law enforcement. Leadership is chosen by lottery, and the winner becomes the Great Senpai, supreme leader of the Student Board.\n\nUnfortunately, Tokiwano Gakuen is far better at recreating school life than surviving. Its militias are poorly organized, defenses are neglected, and Schools are routinely looted, burned, or wiped out by hostile forces.\n\nYet nothing changes. Each generation rebuilds the School, reopens the clubs, and resumes its rivalries, romances, and tea parties as though the previous massacre had been little more than an unusually disruptive semester.</description>
